    {
      "title": "Log In",
      "desc": "A password check without the password",
      "detail": "The server sends a random challenge. The router answers with its username, alex@fibre.example, and an MD5 hash of the challenge and its password, so the password itself never crosses the line. The server checks the answer with the provider’s RADIUS server, then says Success.",
      "facts": [
